// A binary expression over a receiver field is well-formed method body syntax
// the current HIR/MIR/LIR slice does not admit. The body checker drains the
// enclosing method as the method capability code ZOM4125 on the binary
// expression, never as a MissingRequiredFact invariant or an internal compiler
// error.

